OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man dies
OL,4,Afollowing pub assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after a man died following an
OL,8,Faltercation at a pub.
OL,10,FPolice were called to The Star Hotel,
OL,11,Fin Cudworth, Barnsley, just before
OL,12,F23:30 BST on Friday, where an injured
OL,13,Fman was found.
OL,15,FThe victim, in his 50s, had been
OL,16,Fassaulted by another man following an
OL,17,Faltercation, according to South
OL,18,FYorkshire Police. He died in hospital.
OL,20,FA 34-year-old man was arrested on
OL,21,FSaturday morning on suspicion of murder
OL,22,Fand remains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
